# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only build inputs.
**

# Re-include source roots. Docker does not traverse an excluded directory.
!api/
!api/**
!cmd/
!cmd/**
!internal/
!internal/**

# Tests are not needed to build the manager image.
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files.
!go.mod
!go.sum
